  "copyright": "Copyright © 2025 Joshua Hess. All rights reserved.  Block Farm Editor — Proprietary Visual Editor for Umbraco.  This software and its source code are the exclusive property of Joshua Hess. Unauthorized copying, distribution, modification, or use of this software, in whole or in part, is strictly prohibited without prior written permission from the copyright holder.  For licensing inquiries, please contact: blockfarmeditor@gmail.com.  Block Farm Editor and its associated trademarks are the property of Joshua Hess.",
  "created": "2026-01-15T23:44:31.637Z",
  "description": "Block Farm Editor For Umbraco.\n        Allows for easy on page editing using the built in Umbraco data types and property editors.\n        1.0.0 initial release for testing.\n        1.0.1 updated the licensing to be more cost effective\n        1.0.2 Implemented a AddBlockFarmEditor Method.  Removed Composer.  Will ReAdd that in a seperate project.\n        1.0.3 Added in the parent block edit functionality.\n        1.0.4 Fully integrated the umbraco valueeditors and converters.\n        1.1.0 Added the show layers feature and stabilized the block movement.\n        1.1.1 Resolved a movment issue with sibling areas.\n        1.1.2 Resolved issue with the block list\n        1.2.0 Switched to using data types instead of property editors directly. Added allowed-blocks to the tag helper.\n        2.0.0 Switched to using Element Document Types for Blocks\n        17.0.0 Updated to be compatible with Umbraco 17\n        17.0.1 Converted Layout to IEntity Type\n        17.1.0 Added support for saving layouts\n        17.1.2 Bugfixes for the layouts and a few enhancements.",
